  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CISU DERF (2019-2020) - Civil Society in Development&apos;s (CISU) Danish Emergency Relief Fund (DERF) 2019-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic objectives: The goal (impact level) of the DERF is to prevent loss of life and escalation of suffering among people affected by an acute humanitarian crisis. By establishing a pool of funds that is rapid, effective, and relevant, with integrity and flexibility (output level),  the DERF responds to acute humanitarian crisis situations and reaches affected populations by responding to their needs (outcome level).</narrative>
  </description>
